他这个道理"},{"number":195,"start":"00:07:10","end":"00:07:13","text":"简单的就像是你像以前家里边都穷"},{"number":196,"start":"00:07:13","end":"00:07:15","text":"多少年前咱们家里边都穷"},{"number":197,"start":"00:07:15","end":"00:07:18","text":"你晚饭吃饱了的孩子不至于二半夜起来的话"},{"number":198,"start":"00:07:18","end":"00:07:22","text":"上厨房去偷馒头吃嗯"},{"number":199,"start":"00:07:22","end":"00:07:23","text":"好不好嗯"},{"number":200,"start":"00:07:23","end":"00:07:24","text":"好的好的"},{"number":201,"start":"00:07:24","end":"00:07:27","text":"然后呃我没有什么"},{"number":202,"start":"00:07:27","end":"00:07:29","text":"欢迎进入音响模式"},{"number":203,"start":"00:07:29","end":"00:07:33","text":"您可使用语音点歌或连接蓝牙播放"},{"number":204,"start":"00:07:33","end":"00:07:34","text":"没有没有"},{"number":205,"start":"00:07:34","end":"00:07:37","text":"就是那个音箱那个小猫误触了嗯"},{"number":206,"start":"00:07:37","end":"00:07:41","text":"小度小度请把空调调到30度"},{"number":207,"start":"00:07:41","end":"00:07:42","text":"网络未连接"},{"number":208,"start":"00:07:44","end":"00:07:45","text":"拜拜"},{"number":209,"start":"00:07:48","end":"00:07:48","text":"小杜小杜"},{"number":210,"start":"00:07:48","end":"00:07:50","text":"你网络都没连接"},{"number":211,"start":"00:07:50","end":"00:07:51","text":"你怎么在那叨叨"},{"number":212,"start":"00:07:53","end":"00:07:54","text":"小度小度"},{"number":213,"start":"00:07:54","end":"00:07:57","text":"请把窗帘打开"},{"number":214,"start":"00:07:59","end":"00:08:03","text":"小爱同学播放摇滚乐"},{"number":215,"start":"00:08:06","end":"00:08:08","text":"嘿SIRI"},{"number":216,"start":"00:08:08","end":"00:08:10","text":"拨打前女友"},{"number":217,"start":"00:08:14","end":"00:08:15","text":"朋友们赶紧去看手机啊"}],"sameDate":[{"slug":"2026-03-14-call-01","title":"36岁单身女问人生意义，咨询师说当下即最好","date":"2026-03-14","duration":"30分22秒","index":735,"callNumber":1,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-03-14-call-01"},{"slug":"2026-03-14-call-02","title":"内耗音乐老师想通过助人修心，冰哥建议意识层面加强","date":"2026-03-14","duration":"8分26秒","index":736,"callNumber":2,"rawTranscriptUrl":"/raw/2026-03-14-call-02"},{"slug":"2026-03-14-call-05","title":"